    "text": "From beef to mushrooms\nFor decades, Jim said he followed the classic bodybuilding blueprint: heavy weights and even heavier protein from dairy and meat. However, as he entered his nineties, he realised his body was no longer recovery-friendly. Recognising that inflammation was the enemy of ageing joints and muscles, he performed a total dietary overhaul. His new regime focused on healthy fats and anti-inflammatory foods.",
